summary_es:

Hi there, my name is Dario Guzman. I'm a Colombian 🇨🇴 Software Engineer, Web Developer & AI / Computer Vision enthusiast with 10+ years of experience in Python, Django, startups, structuring scalable web applications from start, re-implementation of legacy systems and integrations with third party services.

Expertise building APIs and websites with Django in Python. Familiar with automation strategies and quality assurance standards. Setting up fault tolerant, scalable hosting environments using AWS EC2 services. Using Ubuntu Server / Amazon Linux.
